This ability works the exact same way for enemies as it does for [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|cats]]. 

[[Long Distance]] gives the enemy a set area or effective range where the enemy's attacks inflict damage. Like cat units, they also have a "trigger range".

:''Example:'' '''[[Croakley]]''' has an effective range of 1,100~1,400, but has a trigger range of 900. This means that once a cat unit is 900px away from Croakley, he will attack, only hitting the area that is 1,100~1,400px away from him

